      "message": "This is likely not what you want to do - `response.handle` and `response.attr_value` are in a union, which means *only one* of them is likely valid at a time. Rust does not have a notion of an \"active field\", so this is not UB because the two fields both have all bit patterns valid, but what you *print* will not be meaningful.",
